,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p013","chapter_id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji075-039","person_id":"sba_huu_hk2","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-075-mengchang"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","rationale":"依局部敘事姓名、書信受話及回指暫接。第11段其後齊王限接前段齊湣王，馮驩初敘與復位故事中的齊秦兩王未自動接湣襄或昭王；內嵌秦王王君與外層孟嘗君君稱分辨。馮驩馮先生馮公與局部驩相配，馮軾與代舍非其人名。親弗、周最與原字保留，魏冉書信子稱按受話限定；孟嘗諸子不補個別子嗣。","surfaces":["齊襄王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p013","quote":"後齊湣王滅宋，益驕，欲去孟嘗君。孟嘗君恐，乃如魏。魏昭王以爲相，西合於秦、趙，與燕共伐破齊。齊湣王亡在莒，遂死焉。齊襄王立，而孟嘗君中立於諸侯，無所屬。齊襄王新立，畏孟嘗君，與連和，復親薛公。文卒，謚爲孟嘗君。諸子爭立，而齊魏共滅薛。孟嘗絶嗣無後也。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:p013","text":"後齊湣王滅宋，益驕，欲去孟嘗君。孟嘗君恐，乃如魏。魏昭王以爲相，西合於秦、趙，與燕共伐破齊。齊湣王亡在莒，遂死焉。齊襄王立，而孟嘗君中立於諸侯，無所屬。齊襄王新立，畏孟嘗君，與連和，復親薛公。文卒，謚爲孟嘗君。諸子爭立，而齊魏共滅薛。孟嘗絶嗣無後也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m013-0001","start":1,"end":4,"surface":"齊湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"u68_y0a_f8x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m013-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m013-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"7s4_7ac_lhn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m013-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"魏昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"2ek_pbu_zht","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m013-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"齊湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"u68_y0a_f8x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-075-mengchang:m013-0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"齊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"sba_huu_hk2","status":"context